    </head><body class="__variable_geist_0gdoon9 __variable_geist_mono_08lusff antialiased"><div class="marketing-page"><header class="marketing-header"><a class="marketing-brand" href="#top" aria-label="PlotPickle Playhouse home"><img class="marketing-brand-logo" src="/brand/plotpickle-header-horizontal-600.png" alt="PlotPickle Playhouse"/></a><nav aria-label="Product navigation"><a href="#features">Features</a><a href="#how-it-works">How it works</a><a href="#download">Download</a></nav><button type="button" class="secondary-button marketing-online-button">Open local workspace</button></header><main id="top"><section class="marketing-hero"><div class="marketing-hero-copy"><p class="marketing-kicker">The 24 Blocks story development system</p><h1>Build the story.<br/>See the whole film.</h1><p class="marketing-lede">PlotPickle Playhouse brings the method, the writing plan, and the visual board into one connected workspace—ready to run on your Windows computer.</p><div class="marketing-hero-actions"><a class="download-button" href="https://github.com/BryanHarrisScripts/PlotPickle/releases/latest" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer"><span class="download-icon" aria-hidden="true">↓</span><span><strong>Download for Windows</strong><small>Get the latest PlotPickle package</small></span></a><button type="button" class="marketing-text-link">Open local workspace <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></button></div><div class="marketing-trust-row" aria-label="Product highlights"><span>Local-first</span><span>One story file</span><span>No ChatGPT account required</span></div></div><div class="product-window" aria-label="PlotPickle Playhouse interface preview"><div class="product-window-bar"><span class="product-window-brand"><i><img src="/brand/favicon/plotpickle-icon-32.png" alt=""/></i> PlotPickle Playhouse</span><span>Saved on this device</span></div><div class="product-window-body"><aside><div class=""><span>SS</span><strong>Simple Start</strong><i aria-hidden="true">✓</i></div><div class=""><span>OV</span><strong>Project Overview</strong><i aria-hidden="true">✓</i></div><div class=""><span>01</span><strong>Story Setup</strong><i aria-hidden="true">✓</i></div><div class=""><span>PV</span><strong>Pitch &amp; Vision</strong><i aria-hidden="true">✓</i></div><div class=""><span>WD</span><strong>World</strong><i aria-hidden="true">✓</i></div><div class=""><span>CH</span><strong>Characters</strong><i aria-hidden="true">✓</i></div><div class=""><span>GH</span><strong>Ghost</strong><i aria-hidden="true">✓</i></div><div class=""><span>CA</span><strong>Catalyst</strong><i aria-hidden="true">✓</i></div><div class=""><span>FN</span><strong>Foundations</strong></div><div class=""><span>PK</span><strong>The Pickle</strong></div><div class=""><span>DL</span><strong>Dialogue</strong></div><div class=""><span>CM</span><strong>Core Model</strong></div><div class=""><span>ST</span><strong>Structure Map</strong></div><div class="active"><span>24</span><strong>24 Blocks</strong></div><div class=""><span>SB</span><strong>Storyboard</strong></div><div class=""><span>NT</span><strong>Notes</strong></div></aside><div class="product-workspace"><div class="product-tabs"><span>Learn</span><span class="active">Plan</span><span>Write</span><span>Storyboard</span><span>Refine</span></div><div class="product-workspace-heading"><div><small>ACT II · CONFRONTATION</small><strong>Your complete story at a glance</strong></div><span>18% complete</span></div><div class="block-preview-grid"><div class=""><span>7</span><strong>Story movement</strong><small>Ready</small></div><div class=""><span>8</span><strong>Story movement</strong><small>Ready</small></div><div class="active"><span>9</span><strong>Choices &amp; Adjusted Plan</strong><small>Developing</small></div><div class=""><span>10</span><strong>Story movement</strong><small>Ready</small></div><div class=""><span>11</span><strong>Story movement</strong><small>Ready</small></div><div class=""><span>12</span><strong>Plan, Stakes &amp; Action</strong><small>Ready</small></div></div><div class="product-inspector"><small>BLOCK 9</small><strong>Choices &amp; Adjusted Plan</strong><p>The story text, notes, storyboard direction, and visual frames stay connected to the same block.</p></div></div></div></div></section><section class="marketing-section feature-section" id="features"><div class="marketing-section-heading"><p class="marketing-kicker">One playhouse. Five connected components.</p><h2>A complete path from learning to a finished film plan.</h2><p>Learn, plan, write, storyboard and refine inside one calm, local-first application with one canonical project.</p></div><div class="component-grid"><article class="component-card"><div class="component-visual"><img src="/brand/components/learn.svg" alt="" aria-hidden="true"/></div><div class="component-copy"><span class="feature-code">01</span><p class="feature-label">Learn</p><h3>Learn the craft</h3><p>Use the 81-module learning system and contextual guidance without leaving the active project.</p></div></article><article class="component-card"><div class="component-visual"><img src="/brand/components/plan.svg" alt="" aria-hidden="true"/></div><div class="component-copy"><span class="feature-code">02</span><p class="feature-label">Plan</p><h3>Plan the whole story</h3><p>Shape the story through four acts, twelve sequences, twenty-four blocks and ninety-six mini-blocks.</p></div></article><article class="component-card"><div class="component-visual"><img src="/brand/components/write.svg" alt="" aria-hidden="true"/></div><div class="component-copy"><span class="feature-code">03</span><p class="feature-label">Write</p><h3>Write the screenplay</h3><p>Move from treatment to a complete screenplay with connected scenes, dialogue and revisions.</p></div></article><article class="component-card"><div class="component-visual"><img src="/brand/components/storyboard.svg" alt="" aria-hidden="true"/></div><div class="component-copy"><span class="feature-code">04</span><p class="feature-label">Storyboard</p><h3>See the film</h3><p>Carry approved characters, locations and visual continuity through every storyboard position.</p></div></article><article class="component-card"><div class="component-visual"><img src="/brand/components/refine.svg" alt="" aria-hidden="true"/></div><div class="component-copy"><span class="feature-code">05</span><p class="feature-label">Refine</p><h3>Refine with purpose</h3><p>Use specialist engines, reports and review evidence to improve the story without losing authorship.</p></div></article></div></section><section class="marketing-section story-system-section"><div class="story-system-copy"><p class="marketing-kicker">Your entire story in one structure</p><h2>Twelve story columns. One source of truth.</h2><p>Story Setup, Pitch &amp; Vision, World, Characters, Ghost, Catalyst, Foundations, The Pickle, Dialogue, 24 Blocks, Storyboard, and Notes stay aligned across every workspace.</p><ul><li><span>01</span> One readable <code>.plotpickle.json</code> project file</li><li><span>02</span> Import, export, and move projects between editions</li><li><span>03</span> Your story remains yours and stays on your device</li></ul></div><div class="story-column-stack" aria-label="The twelve PlotPickle story columns"><div class=""><span>SS</span><strong>Simple Start</strong><i aria-hidden="true">→</i></div><div class=""><span>OV</span><strong>Project Overview</strong><i aria-hidden="true">→</i></div><div class=""><span>01</span><strong>Story Setup</strong><i aria-hidden="true">→</i></div><div class=""><span>PV</span><strong>Pitch &amp; Vision</strong><i aria-hidden="true">→</i></div><div class=""><span>WD</span><strong>World</strong><i aria-hidden="true">→</i></div><div class=""><span>CH</span><strong>Characters</strong><i aria-hidden="true">→</i></div><div class=""><span>GH</span><strong>Ghost</strong><i aria-hidden="true">→</i></div><div class=""><span>CA</span><strong>Catalyst</strong><i aria-hidden="true">→</i></div><div class=""><span>FN</span><strong>Foundations</strong><i aria-hidden="true">→</i></div><div class=""><span>PK</span><strong>The Pickle</strong><i aria-hidden="true">→</i></div><div class=""><span>DL</span><strong>Dialogue</strong><i aria-hidden="true">→</i></div><div class=""><span>CM</span><strong>Core Model</strong><i aria-hidden="true">→</i></div><div class=""><span>ST</span><strong>Structure Map</strong><i aria-hidden="true">→</i></div><div class="active"><span>24</span><strong>24 Blocks</strong><i aria-hidden="true">→</i></div><div class=""><span>SB</span><strong>Storyboard</strong><i aria-hidden="true">→</i></div><div class=""><span>NT</span><strong>Notes</strong><i aria-hidden="true">→</i></div></div></section><section class="marketing-section how-section" id="how-it-works"><div class="marketing-section-heading"><p class="marketing-kicker">From download to first block</p><h2>Open the door and start writing.</h2></div><div class="step-grid"><article><span>1</span><h3>Download</h3><p>Get the PlotPickle Playhouse Windows package.</p></article><article><span>2</span><h3>Unzip</h3><p>Extract the folder somewhere easy to find, such as your Desktop.</p></article><article><span>3</span><h3>Start</h3><p>Run the included PlotPickle starter and your browser will open automatically.</p></article><article><span>4</span><h3>Keep it running</h3><p>The command window is PlotPickle&#x27;s private local server. Leave it open while you work; useful errors appear there.</p></article></div></section><section class="download-section" id="download"><div><p class="marketing-kicker">PlotPickle Playhouse for Windows</p><h2>Your story room, on your computer.</h2><p>Download the local-first edition and develop your project without depending on a ChatGPT account.</p><div class="download-details"><span>Windows 10 or 11</span><span>Portable folder</span><span>Local project storage</span></div></div><div class="download-card"><span class="download-card-mark" aria-hidden="true"><img src="/brand/favicon/plotpickle-icon-128.png" alt=""/></span><div><strong>PlotPickle Playhouse</strong><small>Windows edition</small></div><a class="download-button" href="https://github.com/BryanHarrisScripts/PlotPickle/releases/latest" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer"><span class="download-icon" aria-hidden="true">↓</span><span><strong>Download latest</strong><small>Available through GitHub Releases</small></span></a><button type="button" class="marketing-text-link">Open the installed workspace</button></div></section></main><footer class="marketing-footer"><div class="marketing-brand"><img class="marketing-brand-logo" src="/brand/plotpickle-header-horizontal-600.png" alt="PlotPickle Playhouse"/></div><p>Story development built around Bryan Harris&#x27;s 24 Blocks method.</p><div class="marketing-footer-actions"><button type="button">Open local workspace →</button><a href="/about">Why PlotPickle</a><a href="/legal">Copyright &amp; licensing</a><a href="https://github.com/BryanHarrisScripts/PlotPickle" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Source</a></div></footer></div><script id="_R_">import("/assets/index-DBCHrurJ.js")</script></body></html><script>self.__VINEXT_RSC_CHUNKS__=self.__VINEXT_RSC_CHUNKS__||[];self.__VINEXT_RSC_CHUNKS__.push("2:I[\"8c0f216c4604\",[],\"Children\",1]\n3:I[\"f08ec09499bf\",[],\"default\",1]\n4:I[\"96df7669e034\",[],\"default\",1]\n5:I[\"15c18cfaeeff\",[],\"LayoutSegmentProvider\",1]\n6:I[\"8c0f216c4604\",[],\"Slot\",1]\n7:I[\"593f344dc510\",[],\"RedirectBoundary\",1]\n:HL[\"/assets/index-DedKIDsC.css\",\"style\"]\n")</script><script>self.__VINEXT_RSC_CHUNKS__=self.__VINEXT_RSC_CHUNKS__||[];self.__VINEXT_RSC_CHUNKS__.push("0:{\"__route\":\"route:/\",\"__interceptionContext\":null,\"__layoutIds\":[\"layout:/\"],\"__rootLayout\":\"/\",\"page:/\":\"$L1\",\"layout:/\":[[[[\"$\",\"link\",\"css:/assets/index-DedKIDsC.css\",{\"rel\":\"stylesheet\",\"precedence\":\"vite-rsc/importer-resources\",\"href\":\"/assets/index-DedKIDsC.css\",\"data-r